WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Legend tells of a girl in the north named Hua Mulan. The court was drafting soldiers, but her father was old, and there was no grown-up elder brother in the family.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:17.060
Mulan decided to disguise herself as a man and join the army in her father's place. She cut off her long hair and put on armor.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:25.360
In the army, she trained together with the male soldiers and shared their hardships — no one ever discovered that she was a woman.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:32.300
Mulan fought bravely on the battlefield, and over the years she won splendid military honors.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:38.900
After the war ended, Mulan returned to her hometown, and at last she could change back into women's clothes.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:51.780
When her comrades saw that the great hero had actually been a woman all along, they were too amazed to speak. The Ballad of Mulan has passed this story down for a thousand years.

